      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KAELIX JEWEL (1) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Recorded a 7 length win (22.87) in a Grade 5 last time at Horsham. Expected to go close. SILVER SEQUINS (2) is a fast beginner who appreciated the inside draw with an all the way win (21.97) at Warrnambool in Mix 6/7 over 390m. Superior out of the boxes and will be in the firing line early. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Must be included in calculations. PAW ELODEE (5) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Bendigo behind Not Sorry (24.27) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Form from her last run is proving strong. Expected to feature again. CHEEKY STREAK (7) has strong credentials from this draw.",
